cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gharc: A stream-and-filter tool for the GitHub Archive on commodity hardware"
abstract: >-
  gharc filters the GitHub Archive on commodity hardware by streaming
  each hourly archive through memory and writing only matching events
  to Parquet or JSONL. Peak local storage stays bounded by the downloads
  in flight at once, one temporary file per worker, rather than by the
  time range processed.
